{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/f2456dbf9834c81e287286c61c151032e73d9892138f943a9d588cf02e8f125576fd31508dadb527d40cc5f56d4d91212c6312793ee4fc95a4180b63813b3971","height":192,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/J3SDcKnU4gCPZoeNlzYVHXLiNygU7BAX1fcDSJpaiXRsXcVoU8xMRUpvmf_ic0xZvWMYKyje8YNcrmIq267paboAGBRyYgOafWS1","width":192},"name":"Una Kravets","title":"Developer Advocate"},"document_id":5255898378010624,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":["```\n$height: $mdc-button-height + $mdc-density-interval * $density-scale\n/// @example 36px + 4px * (-3) => 24px\n```","```\nnpm install @material/button\n```","```\n<button class=”mdc-button”>\n  <div class=”mdc-button__ripple”></div>\n  <span class=”mdc-button__label”>Button</span>\n</button>\n```","```\n@import “@material/button/mdc-button”;\n@import “@material/button/mixins”;\n.my-button {\n  // This is where you set your density value\n  @include mdc-button-density(-3);\n}\n```"],"content":"<p>对任何前端开发者来说，布局与间距都是常见难题。你的用户界面应该有多紧凑？一套设计系统真的能覆盖产品中所有不同的布局吗？Material 正是来帮忙的。</p>\n<p>我们密度指南的最新更新包含<a href=\"https://material.io/design/layout/applying-density.html\">一套在数字产品中应用密度与间距的全新系统化方法</a>。现在，你可以调整产品的间距，以适应不同用例的布局，例如数据密集型布局与只有单一行动号召（call-to-action）的布局。</p>\n<blockquote><strong>正如你使用 Material Theming 系统化地为 UI 应用颜色、字体排印和形状一样，现在你也可以系统化地应用密度。</strong></blockquote>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>全局密度更改会在宏观层面影响所有元素之间的间距。不过，你也可以为任何单个组件应用定制的密度值。</p>\n<p>Material Design 的密度刻度包含三个密度级别：<strong>默认（default）</strong>、<strong>舒适（comfortable）</strong>和<strong>紧凑（compact）</strong>。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>应用密度的规则</h2>\n<p>对于需要在狭小空间内展示大量信息的数据密集型应用来说，紧凑密度可能非常合适。例如，数据表格或长表单都可以从提高密度中受益。这样可以在页面上呈现更多信息，让用户随时获得重要的关联上下文。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>然而，在涉及专注任务或小型用户输入的布局中，提高密度的显示方式可能就不那么有用了。例如，日期选择器需要充足的空间，用户才能准确做出选择。高密度间距也会让提醒和消息变得难以察觉和阅读。</p>\n<p>在某些情况下，提高密度还可能降低 UI 的无障碍性，因此请确保在用户反馈不受影响的地方应用密度。这个高密度的日历 UI 就是一个例子，说明提高密度可能会让应用更难使用。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=3&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>在为 UI 应用密度时，牢记无障碍非常重要。<strong>无论密度如何，所有触控目标的尺寸都应至少为 `48px`。</strong></p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=4&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>对于高密度布局中的按钮，我们应用了外部内边距，这样即使按钮看起来更小、更紧凑，它们仍然拥有符合无障碍要求的触控目标尺寸。</p>\n<p>在高密度布局中保持良好的设计平衡十分重要，因此在提高组件密度的同时，你还应当<em>降低</em>布局或网格的密度。也就是说，组件越密集，页边距和栏间距就应该越大。这有助于保持 UI 的清晰易读。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=5&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>在 Web 上使用密度</h2>\n<p><strong>密度刻度</strong></p>\n<p>密度由一个刻度定义，默认密度为 0。随着组件之间的空间减小，刻度向负数方向移动（-1、-2、-3），形成密度更高的布局。每增加一档，组件的高度也会减少 4px，但不会影响组件内部的水平间距。例如，在图标按钮中，提高密度不会让图标看起来更靠近文字。</p>\n<p>组件的高度或尺寸使用以下公式计算：</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>来看点代码</strong></p>\n<p>当你更新到最新版本的 MDC（4.0.0 或更高）时，密度已作为 mixin 包含在组件中。你可以应用以下代码，为按钮设置 `-3` 的密度（最紧凑的选项）：</p>\n<p>在终端中，通过以下命令安装 MDC 按钮：</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p>在 HTML 中，添加以下按钮标记：</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p><em>注意：此标记与 MDC 的上一个版本（3.0.0）不同</em></p>\n<p>在 Sass 文件中，导入按钮 mixin，并将密度作为 mixin 应用到你的自定义按钮上：</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=3&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=6&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>以下组件目前提供密度 Sass mixin：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/buttons/#sass-mixins\">按钮</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/input-controls/checkboxes/#sass-mixins\">复选框</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/chips/#sass-mixins\">信息条（Chip）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/data-tables/#sass-mixins\">数据表格</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/buttons/icon-buttons/#sass-mixins\">图标按钮</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/lists/#sass-mixins\">列表</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/input-controls/radio-buttons/#sass-mixins\">单选按钮</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/input-controls/switches/#sass-mixins\">开关</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/tabs/tab-bar/#sass-mixins\">标签栏</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/components/web/catalog/input-controls/text-field/#sass-mixins\">文本框</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>我们建议使用提供的密度 mixin 来自定义密度，而不是随意设置组件高度。</p>\n<p>基本就是这些了！你可以查看<a href=\"https://material.io/design/layout/applying-density.html\">更新后的设计指南</a>了解更多细节，不过借助新的 MDC 4.0，应用密度刻度轻而易举。如果你在自己的应用中应用了密度，请在 Twitter 上联系我们 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/materialdesign\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">@MaterialDesign</span></a>。我们很乐意看到你的作品。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"Various Material themes created by adjusting color, shape, and typography.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/e71620c02f06e150abe3b274b0c641ede706e0b2504b93f6fa847e5dbe90883a67be028d0ac30dd0c1d57c647976c860cf265e7d257288ccac655ed43a245bf9","height":1398,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/F8hhbo6k-xtQobrVXyVPq5sMtq55LdYNK-vF1FuoiHNAskmChocIq25FY_5zwXKhEfBTv9v1FDSo9z9ajBT4C_w5waSj0WLtBO-kQg","width":1400}},{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"A demo of Material’s density scale in action, created by engineer Abhinay Omkar.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/0a5bf4cfe57725a7b7ae433e57b40c8a60d6a753285b5ef715e3aca0b90d28f61d96afa90ef9b20f8cb95fd698609025ae46a1814f89b21300272a7302179f49","height":860,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/EVnaNboEUFzvG7vAgiB1ms8RVVq_eoEnbWeIL-qANCNshmQPlYnOz0MZ83iJUyyKy1AmELd2DdsKQJXHv1lJbBsuRjUMMq7OnkJgTw","width":1000}},{"a11y_description":"List items and text fields shown in default, comfortable, and compact densities","bordered":true,"caption":"https://material.io/design/layout/applying-density.html#usage","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/a331b2fbf8f137e17de0d5f35140ee05f00997d853a03b601ab2fe8d095c048435e646b9ff3e4565ad796aa78249726aea7334e8d6cdd8feb04f8a2fd55b6bbb","height":550,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/SvqXdrALyOlRHQnYC4HtXjAjlgKg8wmlyWI7_IoSGhJtWYnA7_stDRe2RcAHGdLmuZ44gxQomC3Ou892hRxnJWIHOdoh9dO98OBI","width":1100}},{"a11y_description":"Date picker displaying September and October, with highlighted dates","bordered":true,"caption":"An example of where not to use a higher density display. The increased density makes it more difficult for users to interact with the dates in this calendar.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/6ebb708168ec7ab496c16229f888f6464cf21fb1144144f0688be9d039e1d128252de57b9c8cd907d99536adfdc873d4be45fd81956076b6f17065e3b99b86f2","height":478,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/6LmJ81p_ndW4jg3xhQX71w38pETsqLzveFlWS-FUlft6y9UH_VfBogRFc1L7VfUe7i4pVfsUDv7uxsl7LM9XwCmmNm6jzFnxDvfX8g","width":1400}},{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"Even though density can visually decrease, it’s important for touch targets to remain at least 48px in size.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/3aa8f66699964ad9aeb312c168ac364efab8dc564da14c8bef22117d4f7e2d40e67bf09b3c9eae2ca520019bc1374aa9e6fde34931298e9abb6505c387565959","height":478,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Vi-Xzj_EFwXoGr5AXM_EAlH3fD1mRpUSHLJx-Q_46M_jRBNtFmX1U3kP0D8E7bvmlZ8VdPbi4sjBSK7AqcAVq9_bSZb0UWMXrefZYg","width":1400}},{"a11y_description":"Dense app overlaid with columns illustrating its wider horizontal spacing","bordered":true,"caption":"Increase horizontal spacing as you decrease vertical spacing.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/15d9bfd5de80181e078721932dba76e7d52b1e176bf8ba5f95933df982711dda058906080f0516f54799c911f9d01ae86ba5544a43a8e0f39cc1a8765c19c659","height":520,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/j516C0DxGclTIpdxPWDWVXMKdOggEuO0Bd4_ZRuCFUW8XTkc-EA6L1O0KgxA8fOBddURVPNR2iZnHytWCnCgzKcPSZR-vNtuFMTPi6M","width":1100}},{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":"Various density values change the vertical spacing in the button component.","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/cd9119587245c852b3c0cb7dbe8ab02f3b04b3f8a648d9e94a8d3364f254554f2aeb242aaa4e453f014a601a9f01f2ee3b031332e3868419b753e8207cdf515e","height":190,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/HxVn_7TPzEqlIktSr3gXhkAt6gmQxjZ251Qyr9MzV6PtEffngRdgyaNztV8_2UunNabj6m6cQ2eN-HunK7-PaiJ0i4W0GXe07jTrUA","width":1050}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2020","hero":{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/86dedc41c33abb8c3fe08f334f7b6cbf8f4685068e844131e717337311f5b3acf539d0eda2435a2066d8f2bc4d67a0ae98a980cb89b5e7efbafcf8693ec75d82","height":2918,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/qGEdgWMxq2N_sW_BueogGolL8ogI1OH-bGMzhZNeLW7eWTMFgIuECRquT-to3lVaPz2xB0Of1gkclBGRM_crDbuQksdm8JxZ5fqN","width":5834}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":"Density, How-to","meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"将默认、舒适和紧凑密度应用于应用的实操指南","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/4618e705c0d29f0ea3f869ffc11ce71b1f40c6b93ac98333315c4406854738a4e6fde6ca3fa6ba72294a756869316572c3d47f8955443f70a0b2ab10d5d31582","height":2918,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IJcO4jYFGqfyqJyZuVg3R4VWVqXHCgQnA9Xqi-5lk2OYaGJc4DKBx7U3HkCuyF77W6zSuGvKXrpuUZ7AITF81dzbqalNlzkX8KaEQFA","width":5834},"share_title":"Use Material Density on the Web"},"published_date":"2020-01-16T13:00:00","slug":"material-density-web","subtitle":"将默认、舒适和紧凑密度应用于应用的实操指南","title":"在 Web 上使用 Material 密度","up_next":{"items":[{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/c6ab36f153959e497a2a31d1335c5d732dc082acff79ced7c248a545e60e1d6cef9d89e5cf63ec7bd0b873255f54aae040d63c4d157d4bc7a2e9e11d4d3f1261","height":360,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/cV1zATkGghablr-00xFY45NQLUBScMtq0zC5DcMQu6lajMKyQsUKlwfa2qmaF8IU2PXPilLD-1Rk-3O6mEmaxJ9uQp_NOgEssprWAn8","width":720},"link":{"aria_label":null,"href":"/design/layout/applying-density.html","label":null,"open_new_window":false},"section":"Layout","title":"Density"},"document_id":5077444695687168,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/7bbd8dbc40e9bb70ada1a87ec1d452185fa1bd23acf217dfa51f2b67d3e72a68eb03d290d7e9597fd4b2df021c1576b89b9fb505ec454d2b9c9392a50b683326","height":5001,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1T6DD1rCMym64PMEPWDZkXntz8DRWfB7ac7RWS2k_nH1goLXbSZLkQbYBcj2zk3hXyUI9NLkuE-bINnvvb6-STbawnxnzVlsd4mx","width":6251},"link":{"aria_label":null,"href":"/blog/design-material-theme-type","label":null,"open_new_window":false},"section":"Material Blog","title":"Designing a Material Theme: Typography"},"document_id":4930097147281408,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}]},"document_id":"6660569227329536"}